graph TD
    IDLE["Idle"] --> START["s: start trace"]
    START -->|spawn thread| PERFETTO["adb shell perfetto -d --txt -c - -o /data/misc/perfetto-traces/msh_trace\nConfig: 512MB ring buffers, 30min\nCaptures: ftrace (gfx, input, view), process stats, system stats"]
    PERFETTO -->|"mpsc Ok"| RECORDING["Recording\n(shows elapsed time)"]
    PERFETTO -->|"mpsc Err"| FAILED["Show error, return to idle"]

    RECORDING --> STOP["s: stop trace"]
    STOP -->|spawn thread| PULL["1. adb shell pkill -INT perfetto\n2. adb pull trace file\n→ ~/tmp/msh/&lt;pkg&gt;/traces/"]
    PULL -->|"mpsc Ok(path)"| OPEN["Open in Perfetto UI\n(TCP bridge to ui.perfetto.dev)"]
    PULL -->|"mpsc Err"| SHOW_ERR["Show error"]

    OPEN --> LIST["Trace list\n(pulled traces)"]
    LIST --> NAV["Navigate (Up/Down)"]
    NAV --> REOPEN["Enter: reopen in Perfetto UI"]

    subgraph KEYS["Key Bindings"]
        direction LR
        K1["s: start/stop trace"]
        K2["Up/Down: navigate traces"]
        K3["Enter: open trace"]
        K4["Esc: unfocus"]
    end
